cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Lex — point-in-time retrieval of Luxembourg and EU law"
message: "If you use this software, please cite it."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Hajji
    given-names: Soufien
repository-code: "https://github.com/SFHAJJI/lex"
url: "https://law.soufien.lu"
abstract: >-
  An engine for point-in-time retrieval of consolidated regulatory text: verbatim ingestion
  of official publisher bytes with append-only observation chains, deterministic derivation
  into per-provision records under immutable extraction profiles, signed SQLite indexes with
  provision-level search, and eight read-only MCP tools (as_of, timeline, in_force_on, diff,
  search, provenance, article_history, coverage) that answer with dates, hashes and explicit
  refusals rather than guesses.
keywords:
  - legal-tech
  - point-in-time
  - model-context-protocol
  - provenance
  - legislation
  - retrieval
license: Apache-2.0
